              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw ivyahora bimbera inyungu ndavyiyumvira kw ar’ ubuhombe kubga Kristo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka mbere n’ibintu vyose ndavyiyumvira kw ar’ ubuhombe, kubg’ ikibirengeye, ni co kumenya Kristo Yesu Umwami wanje. Kubg’ uwo nahomvye ibintu vyose, ndavyiyumvira kw ar’ ishano, kugira ngo ndonke Kristo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 3:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi mboneke ko ndi muri we, ntafise ukwanje kugororoka, kumwe kuva mu vyagezwe, ariko mfise kumwe kuzanwa no kwizera Kristo, ni kwo kugororoka kuva ku Mana, guhabga uwizeye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
